msgid "The interface rejected bus monitor mode: another client holds a connection to it."
msgstr "Vmesnik je zavrnil način monitorja vodila: z njim je povezan drug odjemalec."

msgid "The bus monitor connects the interface in bus monitor mode. The normal connection is closed while the bus monitor runs: nothing can be sent or downloaded in that time. Stopping the bus monitor restores the normal connection.\n\nStart the bus monitor?"
msgstr "Monitor vodila poveže vmesnik v načinu monitorja vodila. Med delovanjem monitorja vodila je običajna povezava zaprta: v tem času ni mogoče ničesar poslati ali programirati. Ko monitor vodila ustavite, se običajna povezava obnovi.\n\nŽelite zagnati monitor vodila?"

msgid "Start Bus Monitor"
msgstr "Zagon monitorja vodila"

msgid "The bus monitor connection could not be established."
msgstr "Povezave monitorja vodila ni bilo mogoče vzpostaviti."

msgid "The normal connection is restored."
msgstr "Običajna povezava je obnovljena."

msgid "The interface does not support bus monitor mode."
msgstr "Vmesnik ne podpira načina monitorja vodila."

msgid "The bus monitor is not supported for this connection type. It needs a tunnelling connection."
msgstr "Monitor vodila za to vrsto povezave ni podprt. Potrebuje povezavo s tuneliranjem."

